eo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010<strong>Game Features</strong>\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u27642 female characters dubbed in Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u27642 female characters for H and dominating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u27644K High Quality Dynamic HCG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764Versatile Gameplay Visual Novel + Tower Defence Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764One-handed operation, smooth experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764Character dressing\u00a0+\u00a0character live\u00a02d interaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
